# Two independent barriers in front of the preview pages, so neither alone is load-bearing:
#   1. PEAPOD_PREVIEW=1 at runtime (preview-gate.mjs), off by default.
#   2. this line, which keeps the files out of the image entirely.
# A flag flipped by accident on a production deploy therefore finds nothing to serve.
# Remove this when there is a staging deploy that needs them, and the runtime flag —
# which stays off in production — becomes the only switch.
preview/

# Never ship the design handoff or the raw screenshots: they are working material.
design-refs/
